ag\">Historically Inaccurate Bosses</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/c5d44dd9729d9b9a45fd0aaa15d802f8.poster.avif?t=1667562890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/c5d44dd9729d9b9a45fd0aaa15d802f8.webm?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/c5d44dd9729d9b9a45fd0aaa15d802f8.mp4?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take on works of art come to life in boss battles featuring the likes of The Thinker and the Great Sphinx, leading up to the all-powerful final boss in a showdown like you'd never imagine!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Improved Physics and Destructible Environments</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/57b23bd87dd1c8c834914eded070c588.poster.avif?t=1667562890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/57b23bd87dd1c8c834914eded070c588.webm?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/57b23bd87dd1c8c834914eded070c588.mp4?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With upgraded physics and even more things to be cracked, crushed, flattened, and slammed, rolling various rocks down a hill has never been a more pleasant experience!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Utter Chaos</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/47b6ae048638ae59725675680fbf4477.poster.avif?t=1667562890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/47b6ae048638ae59725675680fbf4477.webm?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/434460/extras/47b6ae048638ae59725675680fbf4477.mp4?t=1667562890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With the addition of brand new defensive units and unique boulders with special traits, chaos reigns supreme so be sure not to take each turn for granite.",
